{"synopsis":"Saat-saat terakhir sebelum novel ini berakhir...\n\nVillain terkuat menemui nasib yang menyedihkan.\nTapi itu bukan akhir dari segalanya.\n\n\"Jadi begini caraku mati.\"\n\nAku yang dulunya adalah seorang penulis novel, terbangun sebagai villain bermata rubah yang tidak pernah dianggap.\n\nSebuah keluarga yang telah terpuruk.\nKehidupan yang dibuang demi balas dendam.\n\nSebuah masa depan yang tersegel dalam tragedi.\n\nAku akan menulis ulang semuanya\nAkhir dari Villain ini.. pasti akan berubah.","alternative_title":"마계 아카데미의 실눈 악역","author":"Baobab","artist":"389 Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"dcd2feb3-265b-4324-b057-4d4f65acecba","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"","date":"2026-01-19","released":"2026-01-19","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38ff1667-033d-4cfd-b5d8-4a7559ce1de5/chapter_ch_60/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38ff1667-033d-4cfd-b5d8-4a7559ce1de5/chapter_ch_60/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38ff1667-033d-4cfd-b5d8-4a7559ce1de5/chapter_ch_60/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38ff1667-033d-4cfd-b5d8-4a7559ce1de5/chapter_ch_60/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38ff1667-033d-4cfd-b5d8-4a7559ce1de5/chapter_ch_60/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38ff1667-033d-4cfd-b5d8-4a7559ce1de5/chapter_ch_60/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38ff1667-033d-4cfd-b5d8-4a7559ce1de5/chapter_ch_60/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38ff1667-033d-4cfd-b5d8-4a7559ce1de5/chapter_ch_60/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38ff1667-033d-4cfd-b5d8-4a7559ce1de5/chapter_ch_60/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38ff1667-033d-4cfd-b5d8-4a7559ce1de5/chapter_ch_60/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"7ec3b90c-e2c8-4e0b-8881-183e02c92e4e","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2026-01-15","released":"2026-01-15","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_38ff1667-033d-4cfd-b5d8-4a7559ce1de5/chapter_ch_59/1.webp","https://assets.shng